# .requirements — PolyCal requirement traceability log
#
# Full workflow: docs/REQUIREMENTS-WORKFLOW.md
#
# PURPOSE
#   Append-only audit trail linking implemented work to Jira (PC-xxx) and git commits.
#   Jira holds planned work; this file records what was delivered and where.
#
# FORMAT (pipe-delimited, one requirement per line)
#   YYYY-MM-DD | <commit-sha> | PC-<n> | <requirement summary> | <primary module path>
#
# RULES
#   - Do not edit or delete completed rows.
#   - Every commit on feature/* branches MUST include a Jira key (PC-123) in the message.
#   - Rows are appended automatically by scripts/append-requirement.ts after each commit.
#   - If .requirements changes after a commit, include it in your next commit or amend.
#
# EXAMPLE
#   2026-06-18 | a1b2c3d | PC-42 | Add weekly calendar view | src/app/calendar/page.tsx
#
# --- log entries below this line ---
2026-06-18 | 9f543bc | PC-2 | add requirements workflow and Jira traceability | .cursorrules
2026-06-18 | b1b2aef | PC-2 | correct branch detection in requirements append | scripts/append-requirement.ts
2026-06-18 | 8631064 | PC-2 | sync requirements log entry for append fix | n/a
2026-06-18 | 428d8a0 | PC-2 | auto-stage .requirements after post-commit | .husky/post-commit
2026-06-18 | 8b444c4 | PC-2 | append requirements log for post-commit staging | n/a
2026-06-18 | 6b085f1 | PC-2 | prevent requirements log append loop | .husky/post-commit
2026-06-18 | 980341c | PC-3 | add npm audit gate for feature to dev | .cursorrules
